# =============================================================================
# Google OAuth 2.0 / Google Identity Services (GIS) Configuration
# =============================================================================
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Select or create project: "KAIRA Technologies"
# 3. Configure OAuth Consent Screen: User Type External, App Name "KAIRA Technologies", Add email/profile scopes
# 4. Under Credentials -> Create Credentials -> OAuth client ID -> Web application
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins:
#        http://localhost:5173
#        http://localhost:5000
#    - Authorized redirect URIs:
#        http://localhost:5000/api/auth/google/callback
#        http://localhost:5173/auth/callback
# 5. Paste your Client ID and Client Secret below:
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5000/api/auth/google/callback
